Polysite plugins: third-party notices
=====================================

The plugins in this repository are distributed under the terms in LICENSE.md. Seven of the ten (analytics, i18n, notifications,
posts, search, share, webhooks) have no third-party runtime dependencies. Three install packages from npm, listed below with their
licences (production dependencies only, read from each plugin's lockfile; development tools are not shipped). All are permissive
(MIT, ISC, BSD-2-Clause, MIT-0, BlueOak-1.0.0), and none carries a copyleft or unknown licence.

The core repository's NOTICE covers the core application, its bundled fonts and the notes on libvips (LGPL) and lightningcss (MPL).
